          <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
              <p class="h5 fw-bolder card-title" id="truncated-urls">Truncated URLs</p>
                <p>Some email applications may break a URL due to line breaks. You may need to cut and paste a URL from your email application into your browser's location field.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
          <div class="card h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
              <p class="h5 fw-bolder card-title" id="case-sensitivity">Case Sensitivity</p>
                <p>URLs are case sensitive. “arin.net/ARIN46” and “arin.net/arin46” are not considered the same by the file server. Please verify that the URL is entered correctly as printed and check capitalization.</p>
